# Generated report cards are build artifacts, regenerable from the JSONL.
reports/*.html

# The canary's JSONL log is NOT ignored: it is the submission's quantitative
# evidence, a committed A/B record of control and shielded accounts trading the
# same live feed. It carries prices, headlines, orders and balances only; the
# credential loader keeps keys out of it, and an e2e check scans every tick for
# credential-shaped fields. The daemon's stderr log is noise, so that one goes.
reports/canary-daemon.log

